              "text": "conclure — \"to conclude\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Après la réunion, nous avons conclu qu'il fallait attendre. After the meeting, we concluded that we had to wait."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past participle conclu. Conclure un accord — to close a deal."
            }
          ]
        },
